data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The user wants me to generate a title for a conversation. The message is about reading campaign context files and following a dispatch instruction (d001). This is a task/instruction message about a campaign workflow.\n\nI need to:\n- Use same language (English)\n- Focus on main topic/question\n- Keep technical terms/numbers exact\n- Remove articles (the, this, my, a, an)\n- No tool names\n- ≤50 characters\n- Single line\n- No explanations\n\nMain topic: Campaign dispatch d001 workflow / following campaign instructions. Key elements: cs-campaign, member.json, inputs, d001.md, dispatch ID d001.\n\nPossible titles:\n- \"Campaign dispatch d001 workflow\"\n- \"Follow campaign dispatch d001\"\n- \"cs-campaign d001 task instructions\"\n- \"Campaign d001 dispatch instructions\"\n- \"Execute campaign dispatch d001\"\n\nLet me check character counts:\n- \"Campaign dispatch d001 workflow\" = 31 chars\n- \"Follow campaign dispatch d001\" = 28 chars\n- \"Execute campaign dispatch d001\" = 30 chars\n\nThese all work. \"Campaign dispatch d001 workflow\" captures the nature well. Or \"Campaign d001 dispatch instructions\" = 31 chars.\n\nI think \"Campaign dispatch d001 instructions\" is good and natural. = 34 chars.\n\nActually, the user message is the instruction itself - it's telling the assistant what to do. The title should help find this conversation later. The main topic is the campaign dispatch d001 task.\n\nI'll go with \"Campaign dispatch d001 instructions\"."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789958798,"id":"chatcmpl-4649c1a06f5c4ddf8754b40f27dbf435","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

